# Overlay. Both looks.
ipc panels open overlay IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot open
note Scrim (32 % Material / 30 % Glass), toolbar pill centred at y 44; toggles 48 px (Material) / 40 px (Glass). Same as QML.
# First toggle position read from the shot; assumed left part of the pill near (800, 44). click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ptr move 800 44 sleep 200 glide 800 44 100 sleep 200
rec ov-press 0.6 ptr move 800 44 sleep 100 down sleep 400 up
note Material: pressing the first toggle squares corners to 8 and swells about 6 % (settles about 0.22 s); release toggles the widget (corners 16 when on). Compare QML within 1 frame.
wait 1
shot toggled
note The first toggle's widget is shown (on) and the toggle has corners 16 (Material). Same as QML.
# MANUAL: mixer widget: start audio (paplay) and drag a stream slider while the level changes: knob stays under the pointer
# MANUAL: switch (e.g. crosshair dot): Material knob slides on the fast spring with slight overshoot; Glass 220 ms without overshoot (needs the switch position)
# MANUAL: recorder widget: Record pill press -> Material corners 8 + swell (do not start a recording)
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot esc
note Escape closes the overlay.
ipc panels open overlay IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 300 800 sleep 200 click
wait 1
shot scrim-click
note Clicking the scrim closes the overlay (same as QML).
